# Layered on top of .env.local by `pnpm dev:local` (via dotenv-cli) to run the
# dev server in Local Studio mode. Enabling this flag is the only difference
# between `pnpm dev` and `pnpm dev:local`. It lives in a committed file — rather
# than an inline `VITE_LOCAL_STUDIO=true` prefix — so the script also works on
# Windows, where inline env-var prefixes aren't supported.
VITE_LOCAL_STUDIO=true
